[center][size=5][b][color=#fcee0a]A quickhack editor for Cyberpunk 2077, in VS Code.[/color][/b][/size][/center]

[center]Open any quickhack and see every tier in plain words. Change its costs, texts and effects, or make new quickhacks with effects, icons and logic of your own, and try them live in the game.[/center]
[center][/center]
[center][size=3]One of the VS Code tools from the Edgemodders community. They all work together, with optional AI assistants.[/size][/center]
[line]

[quote][size=4][b][color=#fcee0a]0.1.1, the first release, for game 2.5[/color][/b][/size]
[b]This is not a game mod.[/b] It is an extension for VS Code, so install it there (steps below), not with Vortex. The quickhack mods it makes are game mods: they need TweakXL, ArchiveXL and redscript.[/quote][img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/3333/images/37293/37293-1794064055-1101666106.gif[/img]
